{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04349","headline":"代闺人春日 · 刘希夷","name":"代闺人春日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珠帘的晓光，玉颜艳春彩。\n林间鸟鸣唤，户外花相待。\n花鸟惜芳菲，鸟鸣花乱飞。\n人今伴花鸟，日暮不能归。\n池月怜歌扇，山云爱舞衣。\n佳期杨柳陌，携手莫相违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04349.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04349","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}